## 2. COMPLETE CONNECTION MATRIX

### Power Rail Connections
* **Battery (+)** -> TP4056 `BAT+` -> MAX17043 `VCELL`
* **Battery (-)** -> TP4056 `BAT-` -> MAX17043 `GND`
* **TP4056 OUT+** -> MT3608 `VIN+` **AND** ESP32 `5V` / `VIN` pin
* **TP4056 OUT-** -> MT3608 `VIN-` **AND** ESP32 `GND` (All grounds must connect here to create a common ground plane)
* **MT3608 VOUT+ (Set to 5V)** -> 5V Power Rails (IR LED Array, Haptic Motor VCC)
* **ESP32 3V3 Pin** -> 3.3V Power Rails (TFT, SD Card, CC1101, PN532, GPS, PCF8574, Potentiometer)

### Shared SPI Communication Bus
* **ESP32 GPIO 18 (SCK)** -> TFT `CLK` **AND** SD `SCK` **AND** CC1101 `SCK`
* **ESP32 GPIO 19 (MISO)** -> TFT `MISO` **AND** SD `MISO` **AND** CC1101 `MISO`
* **ESP32 GPIO 23 (MOSI)** -> TFT `MOSI` **AND** SD `MOSI` **AND** CC1101 `MOSI`

### Chip Select (CS) & Control Lines
* **ESP32 GPIO 14** -> TFT `CS` (Chip Select)
* **ESP32 GPIO 27** -> TFT `DC` / `RS` (Data / Command)
* **ESP32 GPIO 4** -> TFT `RST` (Reset)
* **ESP32 GPIO 5** -> Micro SD `CS` (Chip Select)
* **ESP32 GPIO 15** -> CC1101 `CS` / `CSN` (Chip Select)

### Shared I2C Communication Bus
* **ESP32 GPIO 21 (SDA)** -> MAX17043 `SDA` **AND** PN532 `SDA` **AND** PCF8574 `SDA`
* **ESP32 GPIO 22 (SCL)** -> MAX17043 `SCL` **AND** PN532 `SCL` **AND** PCF8574 `SCL`

### Dedicated Module Serial & Peripheral Pins
* **ESP32 GPIO 16 (RX2)** -> NEO-6M GPS `TX`
* **ESP32 GPIO 17 (TX2)** -> NEO-6M GPS `RX`
* **ESP32 GPIO 34 (Analog In)** -> Potentiometer Center Pin (Signal pin)
    * *Potentiometer Outer Pin 1 -> ESP32 3V3*
    * *Potentiometer Outer Pin 2 -> ESP32 GND*

### High-Current Transistor Switching Triggers
* **ESP32 GPIO 12 (PWM)** -> Gate Pin of MOSFET 1 (Haptic Vibration Motor driver)
    * *MOSFET 1 Source -> Common GND*
    * *MOSFET 1 Drain -> Haptic Motor Negative (-)*
    * *Haptic Motor Positive (+) -> 5V Rail*
    * *1N4007 Diode -> Placed parallel across Haptic Motor (+ and -) with cathode pointing to +*
    * *10k Ohm Resistor -> Bridged from MOSFET 1 Gate to Common GND*
* **ESP32 GPIO 13 (Digital Out)** -> Gate Pin of MOSFET 2 (940nm IR LED Array driver)
    * *MOSFET 2 Source -> Common GND*
    * *MOSFET 2 Drain -> IR LED Array Negative (-)*
    * *IR LED Array Positive (+) -> 5V Rail*
    * *10k Ohm Resistor -> Bridged from MOSFET 2 Gate to Common GND*

### PCF8574 Port Expander Button Configuration
*(Pins P0 through P6 sit low when pressed/switched. Configure internal pull-ups via software)*
* **PCF8574 P0** -> Tactile Switch 1 (Select Action) -> Terminal to Ground
* **PCF8574 P1** -> Tactile Switch 2 (Back Action) -> Terminal to Ground
* **PCF8574 P2** -> Tactile Switch 3 (Aux Action) -> Terminal to Ground
* **PCF8574 P3** -> EC11 Rotary Encoder Terminal A -> Ground
* **PCF8574 P4** -> EC11 Rotary Encoder Terminal B -> Ground
* **PCF8574 P5** -> EC11 Encoder Integrated Push-Switch -> Ground
* **PCF8574 P6** -> SPDT Slide Switch (Kill-Switch Active position) -> Ground

